n example, I'm checking the A-FDT expected values for intervening on F_x.\n\nSending comes out ahead no matter what r is, since the sending value exceeds quiet's by 1 + r. The open question is whether intervening on F_x could carry over to F_{x'} because the two inputs differ only by renaming. The essay's red/green example treats a copy with a different observation as its own node held at prior, so I'll follow that and defect.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm treating this as a twin prisoner's dilemma with different observations, so the other copy's node is F_{x'} rather than F_x, and intervening on one leaves the other alone unless the graph links them. Following the essay's red/green example, I'm checking the A-FDT expected values for intervening on F_x.\n\nSending comes out ahead no matter what r is, since the sending value exceeds quiet's by 1 + r. The open question is whether intervening on F_x could carry over to F_{x'} because the two inputs differ only by renaming. The essay's red/green example treats a copy with a different observation as its own node held at prior, so I'll follow that and defect.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9867,"completion_tokens":1015,"total_tokens":10882,"cost":0.059768,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.059768,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039468,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0203},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":522,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}